/www.wofs.com/7-quick-tips-career-success/","title":"WOFS: 7 Quick Tips to Bring You Career Success","kind":"author_published_teaching","source_version":"WOFS authored office guidance; scope excludes efficacy claims and wired-phone extrapolation","scope":"书桌座位避开直走道、裸露梁下及朝向人的家具尖角；尖角可选叶状植物作为条件屏障；不采纳健康财富预测","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14","retrieved_sha256":"99ac6d76a5e586015a503875fcc5dc76c3879d24986ecb10f6e74a076aa97c18","retrieved_bytes":220062}],"bundle_version":"1.1.0"},{"ruleset_id":"sourced_material_representation_v1","version":"1.0.0","method":"material_and_shape_reference","source_ids":["M_AFSI","M_FSI"],"scope":"独立属性参考与明确代表物用途的有限资格检查；不是宫位所需元素、个人喜用或摆位处方","conventions":["材质、器形、颜色分别确认，不相互证明","器形不等于尖角指向人的几何关系","AFSI实际代表物与颜色替代分开；FSI形状对应不自动当AFSI调节物","木家具排除只针对AFSI木代表物，不是木家具普遍不吉"],"sources":[{"source_id":"M_AFSI","url":"https://www.amfengshui.com/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce_uploads/2013/12/tpofs.pdf","retrieved_at":"2026-10-15","retrieved_sha256":"6ab5135060df281fd6a6e376e0516e660c185dd2af2f146a5f850df64cc3b024","retrieved_bytes":4418704,"retrieved_format":"raw_pdf","title":"Larry Sang / American Feng Shui Institute: The Principles of Feng Shui","kind":"author_published_book","source_version":"publisher PDF, Chapter 3, printed pp.19-28; PDF pp.36-45 (one-based)","scope":"五行生/克/泄、代表物与色彩；木代表物用活植物，处理木家具不作为该版本木调节物；实际元素优先于颜色","locator":"Printed pp.23,25 / PDF pp.40,42 (one-based), directly verified page images","refresh_note":"2026-10-15 direct HTTP refresh succeeded after earlier 403; original bytes and hash match","verification_note":"2026-10-15 direct HTTP retrieved 4418704 bytes; SHA-256 unchanged; page locators verified"},{"source_id":"M_FSI","url":"https://www.feng-shui-institute.org/Feng_Shui/fiveelements.html","retrieved_at":"2026-10-15","retrieved_sha256":"8eda96846480c9607c93bd5995e4722650e6a90e1637cfc223e8e3379a485659","retrieved_bytes":27084,"retrieved_format":"raw_html","title":"Feng Shui Institute: The Five Elements – Wu Xing","kind":"author_published_teaching","source_version":"official teaching page, accessed 2026-10-15","locator":"Water/Wood/Fire/Earth/Metal Energy sections; shape descriptions only","scope":"五种器形的署名五行参考；不采网页人格/物理学/健康解释，不自动产生禁忌或元素处方"}]},{"ruleset_id":"expert_environment_2026_10_v1","version":"1.0.0","method":"environmental_context","source_ids":["EXPERT20261015","SHUOGUA","SHEN_BRANCHES","DPM_ZODIAC"],"scope":"环境、家庭角色、固定生肖索引与楼层暴露边界；不计算飞星、不替代宅盘、不输出现实因果预测","conventions":["环境五行阴阳不混入本人或周围人的八字、紫微喜忌；八宅命卦匹配独立保留","宫位人物按已确认的家庭辈分与排行；不按谁作主推角色","household_scope是工程查询范围：纯符号参考不绑定现场方区，不是新增传统断法；家庭/生肖宫位索引独立于八宅命卦","妻随夫排行必须显式确认；同一人可保留父母和排行两个身份","家庭角色为主要象征对应，生肖为独立确认的另一象征索引；各自主宫优先，对宫仅次级关注","实地方位、户型对齐和立极均确认后才把象征宫位绑定实际方区","多层按统一方向逐层审查，各层立极和户型对齐独立确认，不继承全宅或其他层中心；院落归第一层；局限本层且异层适宜的条件不外推为全宅抵消","使用人名单只有正向事实；给异层豁免或共享范围外判定前，影响层的室内与院落空间须分别确认使用范围完整及依据，不能由省略名单推不使用","现代开放式厨房和拱门只作低优先提示，不要求因此拆改"],"sources":[{"source_id":"EXPERT20261015","title":"用户提供的专家访谈整理：风水方法、家庭角色与多层住宅（2026-10-15）","url":"","kind":"user_supplied_expert_policy","scope":"本次产品采用的专家口径；专家姓名与原始访谈未提供，不冒称所有流派共识，也不证明现实效力","source_version":"当前聊天用户九条意见，2026-10-15"},{"source_id":"SHUOGUA","title":"《周易·说卦》：八卦与父母、长中少子女","url":"https://ctext.org/book-of-changes/shuo-gua","kind":"classical_text","scope":"乾父、坤母及震坎艮男、巽离兑女的象征；不作为配偶随序、实际户主或现实影响的证明"},{"source_id":"SHEN_BRANCHES","title":"《沈氏玄空学》卷四：九宫挨星掌诀","url":"https://www.diancangwang.cn/xuanxuewushu/f6f37803664b/90b563d9cb41.html","kind":"classical_text_transcription","scope":"九宫与二十四山地支位置的固定对应；不是命盘喜忌或人物受影响结论"},{"source_id":"DPM_ZODIAC","title":"故宫博物院：十二生肖","url":"https://www.dpm.org.cn/lemmas/245505.html","kind":"museum_reference","scope":"十二地支与生肖对应；与掌诀地支位置合成的符号索引，不是命盘匹配"}],"bundle_version":"1.0.0"},{"ruleset_id":"expert_fengshui_methods_v1","version":"1.1.0","method":"fengshui_method_reference","source_ids":["EXPERT_20261015","SHUOGUA_PRIMARY","ZHOUYI_ZHENGYI_PRIMARY","FOUNDATION_S4","FOUNDATION_S5","FOUNDATION_S3","FATEBRIDGE_OBSERVATION_REFERENCE","MEIHUA_TRIGRAM_SYMBOLS","SHEN_VOLUME2_REFERENCE","JOEY_YAP_2018_STAR_THEMES","JOEY_YAP